#. type: Title =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise 5"
msgstr "練習題 5"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:5
msgid "In this exercise you will perform interative steps using rgbif to download, visualize and clean GBIF-mediated data."
msgstr "在此練習中，您將透過 rgbif 執行一系列互動式步驟以下載、視覺化及清理由 GBIF 提供的資料。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:9
msgid "xref:attachment$Ex5-r-tutorial.docx[Download Exercise 5] (MS Word 158 KB)"
msgstr "xref:attachment$Ex5-r-tutorial.docx[下載練習題 5] (MS Word 158 KB)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:13
msgid "xref:software.adoc[Download and install R and R Studio desktop] if you have not already."
msgstr "xref:software.adoc[下載並安裝 R 及 R Studio 桌面版]，若您尚未完成此步驟。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:14
msgid "Save the R Markdown file to your computer: xref:attachment$Lemur_catta_project.Rmd[Lemur_catta_project.Rmd]."
msgstr "將 R Markdown 檔案儲存至您的電腦：xref:attachment$Lemur_catta_project.Rmd[Lemur_catta_project.Rmd]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:15
msgid "Click the link."
msgstr "點擊此連結。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:16
msgid "Right-click within the page and select “Save As”."
msgstr "在頁面內按右鍵，然後選擇「另存為」。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:17
msgid "Name the file as Lemur_catta_project.Rmd (do not include the additional .txt in the file name if the browser tries to include it.)."
msgstr "請將檔案命名為 Lemur_catta_project.Rmd（若瀏覽器試圖在檔案名稱中加入 .txt，請勿包含 .txt）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:18
msgid "Click Save."
msgstr "按下「儲存」。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:19
msgid "Ensure you have the necessary packages installed."
msgstr "請確保已安裝必要的套件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:20
msgid "Read through and perform the steps in the xref:lemur-catta-tutorial.adoc[_Lemur catta_ tutorial]."
msgstr "請仔細閱讀並執行 xref:lemur-catta-tutorial.adoc[_Lemur catta_ 教學指南] 中的步驟。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:21
msgid "Prepare the variables"
msgstr "準備變數"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:22
msgid "Download the data"
msgstr "下載資料"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:23
msgid "Visualize the data"
msgstr "將資料視覺化"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:24
msgid "Clean the data"
msgstr "清理資料"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Challenge"
msgstr "挑戰"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise5.adoc:27
msgid "Adapt the tutorial by using a different species in a different part of the world."
msgstr "請根據不同物種及世界不同地區的情況，對本教學進行調整。"

